                <mxCell id="20" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions CI Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• PR Automated Checks:&lt;br&gt;  1. ESLint &amp;amp; Prettier lint&lt;br&gt;  2. TypeScript &lt;code&gt;tsc --noEmit&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;  3. Vitest unit tests (Parser &amp;amp; Rules)&lt;br&gt;  4. Next.js build verification&lt;br&gt;• Branch protection on &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ffedd5;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;shadow=1;" parent="17" vertex="1">
